        "status": "present",
        "value": "'(' pushes a frame with the next token as operator. A word in a let frame with no pending name and not followed by ')' becomes the pending name. Otherwise a word is looked up and a numeral is parsed; ')' pops a frame and produces add/mult results or the let body after popping its bindings. A produced value goes to the parent frame: an operand for add/mult, a binding if a name is pending, else the let body. With no parent it is the final result."
      },
